Z||000010||fierodave||08-26-2001||01:16 AM||||The last time I heard there was one on the market the kit cost about $4,000 with shipping included. <P>But did not include the large spoiler trunk lid!  <BR>I don't remember which site still sells them or if they are for sale yet,  as I got this car with the kit installed. <BR>If everthing goes as planned the new owner will walk away with this car for a hair over the kits original price with shipping, and it has a New $2,500.00 base clear show quality body work & paint job just done to it!  what a deal this one was!<BR>FD||||reg||1
